OL,3,GNEWSAEscaped horse on A3 prompts road
OL,4,Aclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA horse loose on the A3 prompted a
OL,7,Ftemporary road closure in Surrey,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FA Surrey Police spokesperson said
OL,11,Fofficers were called to reports of a
OL,12,Fhorse on the southbound carriageway of
OL,13,Fthe A3 at Wisley, near Portsmouth Road,
OL,14,Fat about 07:35 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe animal had escaped from a nearby
OL,17,Ffield, forcing the road to close while
OL,18,Fit was safely moved to a nearby service
OL,19,Fstation.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
