OL,3,GNEWSAEscaped horse on A3 prompts road
OL,4,Aclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said a three-vehicle collision
OL,7,Fseparately occurred on the A3 while the
OL,8,Fincident was ongoing and one person was
OL,9,Ftaken to hospital with minor injuries.
